  - id: EV_PUBLICITY
    headline: The bistro makes local news
    summary: Two days of publicity plus a Verdant & Co. promotion.
    details: A local feature brings temporary attention to the bistro. Morning attendance
      uses an additional 500 publicity points for two days. Earned popularity and
      ending scores are unchanged. Verdant & Co. also offers 10% off packages during
      the feature.
    minDay: 2
    maxDay: -1
    durationDays: 2
    weight: 1
